# HB-SAMPLE (CROSS-PORT): Melee Captain CatchDash (retail data from the vanilla disc), retargeted by bone role; owner choice: owner 2026-10-11: the grab family is Captain Falcon's (his animation, grab boxes and throw data on Goku's bones); the retarget was approved by eye in Blender (lane ws/goku-falcon-grabs).
# Hitbox joint, size and offsets are Captain's moved to Goku's bone of the same role (a sphere on the root joint is scaled about it) and scaled by the size ratio 0.7570 (script units: build.py multiplies by 1.4286; the engine then applies Goku's built size 1.2 to the fighter, model and hitboxes alike). Damage, angle, KBG/BKB, timing, auto-cancel and IASA are unchanged; left behind: gfx, sfx.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
wait_until 10
hitbox raw=0x2C000000,0x02120000,0x04F8048E,0xB4990012,0x0020008B
hitbox raw=0x2C800000,0x02120000,0x04F8013E,0xB4990012,0x0020008B
hitbox raw=0x2D000000,0x02120000,0x04F8FEC2,0xB4990012,0x0020008B
throw slot=1 damage=2 angle=0 kbg=50 fkb=0 bkb=70 element=0 sfx_severity=0 sfx_kind=2
wait_until 12
hitboxes_clear
throw_release
